# quple-server, the signaling service at meet.quineglobal.com.
# petersweb-infra runs it pinned by digest (nixos/quple/default.nix);
# .forgejo/workflows/deploy.yml builds it and opens the PR that bumps the pin.
FROM docker.io/library/golang:1.25 AS build
WORKDIR /src
COPY go.mod go.sum ./
RUN go mod download
COPY . .
RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -trimpath -ldflags=-s -o /out/quple-server .

# Static binary on distroless: CA certificates (for login.quineglobal.com's
# discovery and keys), no shell, runs as nonroot (65532).
FROM gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12:nonroot
COPY --from=build /out/quple-server /usr/local/bin/quple-server
ENV ADDR=:8080 DATA_DIR=/data
EXPOSE 8080
VOLUME /data
ENTRYPOINT ["/usr/local/bin/quple-server"]
